  "headline": "Cisplatin is not on FDA's current shortage list as of 2026-10-21; the earlier shortage posted 2023-02-10 is resolved",
  "headline_cites": ["D14"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show cisplatin is not on the current shortage list as of 2026-10-21, and the prior shortage first posted on 2023-02-10 has been resolved.",
      "cites": ["D14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The earlier shortage posting followed an FDA inspection at Thymoorgan Pharmazie Gmbh (FEI 3002320821) that ended 2022-10-06 and was classified VAI, 127 days before the 2023-02-10 posting.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later inspection at the same Thymoorgan plant ended 2023-04-25 and was also classified VAI, 74 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gland Pharma Limited (FEI 3009056604) has a history of VAI inspections, with the most recent classification letter dated 2019-12-10, 1158 days before the 2023-02-10 posting.",
      "cites": ["D13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our inventory shows Corvale East has 16.1 days on hand for the 50 mg/50 mL presentation and 18.7 days for the 1 mg/mL presentation, while Corvale General has 30.9 and 31.0 days respectively.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The preferred purchasing option is Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and whose plant was last inspected VAI on 2023-08-24.",
      "cites": ["D15"]
    }
  ]
}
